  <head><component name="DIS" level="2"/><meta name="title" content="ReceiverPdu.x3d"/><meta name="description" content="Bridge fixture for ReceiverPdu: stores its fields, draws nothing, no connection, no output ever fires (X_ITE 16.6.0)"/></head>
